{'query': 'average cost of daily meals per person in India 2024', 'results': [{'title': 'Cost of Living in Delhi. Sep 2026. Prices in Delhi - Numbeo', 'url': 'https://www.numbeo.com/cost-of-living/in/Delhi', 'snippet': '5 days ago · The estimated monthly costs for a single person are $352.3 (₹33,757.1), excluding rent. Delhi is 75.2% less expensive than Los Angeles (excluding rent, see our cost of living index).'}, {'title': 'India Travel Cost - Average Price of a Vacation to India ...', 'url': 'https://www.budgetyourtrip.com/india', 'snippet': 'Jul 3, 2026 · While restaurant and meal prices in India can vary significantly, the average cost of food in India is $15 (₨1,434) per day, per person, based on the spending habits of previous travelers.'}, {'title': 'Cost of Living in Delhi. Updated Prices Sep 2026.', 'url': 'https://www.livingcost.net/india/delhi', 'snippet': 'Sep 10, 2026 · Latest cost of living data for Delhi shows local prices for housing, food, bills, transport and daily needs.'}, {'title': 'Cost of Living in Delhi: Rent, Food & Expenses Guide', 'url': 'https://ashrayliving.com/cost-of-living-in-delhi', 'snippet': 'Jan 1, 2024 · Discover the cost of living in Delhi, including rent, food, transport, utilities, and more. Plan your budget with our detailed expense breakdown.'}, {'title': 'Cost of Living Estimator for Delhi, India - Numbeo', 'url': 'https://www.numbeo.com/cost-of-living/city-estimator/in/Delhi', 'snippet': 'Cost of Living Estimator for Delhi, India Estimate monthly living expenses in Delhi based on the following household information: Household size Dining-out frequency and restaurant preferences Entertainment spending Cigarette and alcohol consumption Preferred mode of transportation (public transit, taxis, or driving)'}], 'result_count': 5, 'duration_seconds': 7.279912700003479}
{'query': 'cheap vegetarian dinner recipes with ingredients and cost in India', 'results': [{'title': 'Indian dinner recipes for family (vegetarian and easy)', 'url': 'https://priyascurrynation.com/indian-dinner-recipes-for-family/', 'snippet': "Jul 10, 2026 · Looking for easy Indian dinner recipes for family that everyone will enjoy? Whether you're planning a quick weeknight meal, a cozy weekend dinner, or a special vegetarian feast, you'll find plenty of delicious inspiration here."}, {'title': '27 Quick and Easy Vegetarian Indian Dinner Recipes', 'url': 'https://veggiekitchenly.com/quick-and-easy-dinner-recipes-vegetarian-indian/', 'snippet': 'Jun 30, 2026 · With these 27 quick and easy vegetarian Indian dinner recipes, you have a world of flavors at your fingertips. Each dish is not only simple to make but packed with wholesome ingredients to fuel your busy weeknights.'}, {'title': '27 Indian Vegetarian Recipes for Easy Dinners - chefadora.com', 'url': 'https://www.chefadora.com/recipe-collection/27-indian-vegetarian-recipes-for-comforting-everyday-meals', 'snippet': 'Jul 7, 2026 · Explore 27 easy Indian vegetarian recipes, from creamy paneer curries and comforting dal to everyday sabzi and crispy aloo dishes for weeknight dinners.'}, {'title': 'Indian Dinner Recipes | 900+ Veg Dinner Ideas - Tarla Dalal', 'url': 'https://www.tarladalal.com/recipes-for-indian-dinner-939', 'snippet': 'Feb 6, 2026 · Easy Indian Dinner Vegetarian Recipes are perfect for anyone who wants to cook quick meals, enjoy authentic flavors, and use simple ingredients at home. These recipes include a variety of vegetarian dishes, one-pot meals, and healthy options that save both time and effort.'}, {'title': '40+ Best Vegetarian Indian Dinner Recipes (Easy Dinner Ideas)25 Indian Vegetarian Dinner Recipes Full of Flavor for Busy ...10 Easy Indian Vegetarian Dinner Ideas for Busy Weeknights', 'url': 'https://www.indianveggiedelight.com/indian-dinner-recipes/', 'snippet': 'Jan 20, 2023 · Looking for Vegetarian Indian Dinner Recipes? Here are the best 40+ easy, full of flavor Dinner Recipes from curries, stir-fries, lentils, and rice dishes that your family will love. Jul 8, 2026 · Dive into these 25 vibrant Indian vegetarian dinner recipes that burst with flavor, making weeknight meals a delightful experience. Discover how to create satisfying dishes that bring warmth and joy to your busy evenings. I’ve rounded up 10 easy Indian vegetarian dinner ideas that I love making on busy weeknights. Simple, comforting, and full of flavour – perfect for when you want a fuss-free meal.'}], 'result_count': 5, 'duration_seconds': 4.51474730001064}
