{'query': 'cheap breakfast and lunch meal ideas with ingredients and cost in India', 'results': [{'title': 'Indian meal plan for free - Listonic', 'url': 'https://listonic.com/meal-plans/en/indian-meal-plan-for-free', 'snippet': 'Oct 1, 2024 · Eating well on a budget is easy with the Indian Meal Plan for Free. This plan features affordable, nutritious Indian meals that make the most of inexpensive ingredients like lentils, rice, and seasonal vegetables. Enjoy a variety of delicious dishes without breaking the bank.'}, {'title': 'Healthy Weekly Meal Plan: Nutritious And Delicious Indian Recipes', 'url': 'https://fitelo.co/diet/healthy-weekly-meal-plan/', 'snippet': 'Discover an affordable and healthy weekly meal plan tailored for the Indian diet, balancing nutrition, taste, and cost for a healthier you! We all know that healthy eating is vital, but let’s be practical- it feels like a challenge, especially when you’re trying to be on a budget.'}, {'title': 'Full Weekly Indian Meal Plan - Breakfast, Lunch, Dinner', 'url': 'https://flavoursinmykitchen.com/indian-meal-plan-breakfast-lunch-and-dinner-plan/', 'snippet': 'Mar 23, 2019 · All you have to do is read the meal prep, select from the menu ideas, buy the ingredients from the grocery list and enjoy a hassle-free week. All these recipes are cooked with fewer ingredients and easy to cook.'}, {'title': 'Cheap Indian Recipes| Hari Ghotra', 'url': 'https://www.harighotra.co.uk/indian-recipes/dish-type/cheap', 'snippet': 'Once you have stocked your cupboard with the essential herbs and spices, you’re already halfway to creating delicious Indian dishes. We all need cheap meal ideas to get us through the week and I’m positive you’ll find some enticing and filling recipes to inspire you as you browse these recipe pages.'}, {'title': '15 Indian Meal Prep Ideas to Save Time and Money', 'url': 'https://www.mealorie.com/blog/indian-meal-prep-ideas', 'snippet': 'May 28, 2025 · Discover 15 budget-friendly Indian meal prep ideas that combine authentic flavors with modern efficiency for stress-free weeknight cooking.'}], 'result_count': 5, 'duration_seconds': 2.991467300016666}
